WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
See which guard rounds were walked, missed or late, and which areas need cleaning now.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.280
Security & cleaning opens on Today: patrols, cleaning, open incidents and keys that are out.

3
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.160
Anything that needs you is marked in red.

4
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.160
Open Patrols to see every round of the day.

5
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:29.000
How many checkpoints were reached, and how many rounds were missed or late.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.960
Each route shows its rounds: green is complete, amber means checkpoints were skipped, red was missed.

7
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:42.760
Guards scan a sticker at each checkpoint with their phone. Print the stickers from here.

8
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:47.660
Cleaning works the same way, area by area.

9
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:56.580
Every area shows when it was last cleaned and whether it is due. Low shopper ratings raise an alert here too.

10
00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:03.580
Open an area to see each clean: who did it, when and the photos.
